[
  {
    "RowOffset": 640418,
    "RowId": 36455,
    "Text": "Now, I espied something resting within the shrine earlier..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 640490,
    "RowId": 36456,
    "Text": "I have seen depictions of this pipe before. There can be no doubt that it is an age-old treasure."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 640598,
    "RowId": 36457,
    "Text": "Gorai must have known that a fierce tsukumogami slumbered within it. Thus he stored it apart, far from the sanctity of the temple..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 640742,
    "RowId": 36458,
    "Text": "But its will was too strong to be consigned to such ignominy, and in its neglect, its power only grew. Until it was strong enough to enshroud the mount entire... "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 640918,
    "RowId": 36459,
    "Text": "Now that this lord among demons is slain, we can assume that peace shall return to the region. We must report the good news to Mistress Tsubaki posthaste!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641086,
    "RowId": 36460,
    "Text": "I─and my growing collection─should not have fared half so well without you here. I am in your debt! "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641202,
    "RowId": 36461,
    "Text": "Shrink before my might! Quiver in awe!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641254,
    "RowId": 36462,
    "Text": "A path straight up the holy mount, is it? How refreshingly dangerous!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641334,
    "RowId": 36463,
    "Text": "Why, these hills stretch on for malms! Would that they were not alive with the sound of demons."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641442,
    "RowId": 36464,
    "Text": "The Hingans call these clay figures “dogu”─but why is one here, of all places?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641538,
    "RowId": 36465,
    "Text": "Best to let sleeping dogu lie. For all we know, it could be cursed."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641618,
    "RowId": 36466,
    "Text": "If that dogu turns on us, its extermination shall be <i>your</i> responsibility, I hope you know!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641730,
    "RowId": 36467,
    "Text": "Fallen leaves and fresh greenery in such close proximity? 'Tis passing strange."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641822,
    "RowId": 36468,
    "Text": "There are few things more breathtaking than autumnal leaves...even if they are out of season. The influence of a treasure, I suspect."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 641966,
    "RowId": 36469,
    "Text": "I understand you adventurers enjoy the roads less traveled, but─ And there <If(PlayerParameter(4))>she<Else/>he</If> goes. Courage, Hancock!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 642094,
    "RowId": 36470,
    "Text": "Such a tranquil place, these mountain heights. By the look of it, I presume it is not a path that many tread."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 642214,
    "RowId": 36471,
    "Text": "Hmm... 'Tis not the first of those stones we've encountered. Do they serve as shrines of some sort?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 642326,
    "RowId": 36472,
    "Text": "No shrine is built without purpose...or so I have heard. If such is the case, then what might this one be for?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 642450,
    "RowId": 36473,
    "Text": "Oho! I knew from the first that the dogu was meant for something greater."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 642534,
    "RowId": 36474,
    "Text": "I, for one, have <i>naught but respect</i> for our new clay comrade! ...Do you think it can hear us?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 642650,
    "RowId": 36475,
    "Text": "The warding talismans on this boulder give me pause...but it shall serve as well as any bridge, I suppose."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 642770,
    "RowId": 36476,
    "Text": "One cannot go wrong with a rustic log bridge─assuming the trunk is free of angry spirits, of course..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 642886,
    "RowId": 36477,
    "Text": "Gods be good! I know not how, but the statue has awakened...and it did <i>not</i> wake on the right side of the proverbial bed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 643030,
    "RowId": 36478,
    "Text": "Just a moment─I have read of this before! If I am not mistaken, that mononoke is Shishio, king among nue!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 643150,
    "RowId": 36479,
    "Text": "Even a king of beasts is no match for you, I see! Well done, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 643242,
    "RowId": 36480,
    "Text": "The most, in a word, <i>vivid</i> Shishio myth tells of its ravenous rampage across the countryside. It had quite the appetite for mortal flesh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 643402,
    "RowId": 36481,
    "Text": "'Tis also said that its harrowing cry is a harbinger of misfortune, but I say we should consider ourselves lucky to have chanced upon a living legend."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 643566,
    "RowId": 36482,
    "Text": "As for what freed it of its lithic bonds... Perhaps the revelry of its fellow mononoke roused its fighting spirit."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 643694,
    "RowId": 36483,
    "Text": "Alas, the beast held no treasures of Gorai's, but fret not─I shall make do with what we have here and claim a suitable souvenir."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 643838,
    "RowId": 36484,
    "Text": "Though our hike was fraught with peril, 'twas exhilarating in equal measure! You have my thanks, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 643966,
    "RowId": 36485,
    "Text": "A deed fit for legend! Quite literally, for Shishio appears in countless Hingan myths."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 644066,
    "RowId": 36486,
    "Text": "One, in fact, tells of a wayfaring warrior who triumphed over it long ago."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 644154,
    "RowId": 36487,
    "Text": "As such, I was aware that its harrowing cry could warp the very earth...but to see it firsthand is a wholly different beast, I'm sure you agree."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 644310,
    "RowId": 36488,
    "Text": "Though the creature bore none of Gorai's treasures, we can take comfort in the knowledge that it will terrorize Lord Uzumibi's people no more."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 644466,
    "RowId": 36489,
    "Text": "...And in the no less valuable artifacts we've spotted over the course of our journey to the summit, naturally."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 644590,
    "RowId": 36490,
    "Text": "All that remains is to carry the spoils to our waiting falcons. I trust I can count on you?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 644694,
    "RowId": 36491,
    "Text": "That is one mononoke felled─though if the legends are to be believed, Shishio is a wholly different beast than its tsukumogami brethren."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 644846,
    "RowId": 36492,
    "Text": "It came to the mountain long before Gorai's time─was sealed here by the very founder of Shojo Temple, in fact."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 644970,
    "RowId": 36493,
    "Text": "'Tis enough to make one wonder if that boulder we felled did not possess some greater significance..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 645082,
    "RowId": 36494,
    "Text": "But let us turn from that dark path, and instead appreciate the sacred scenery before us! Breathtaking, is it not?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 645210,
    "RowId": 36495,
    "Text": "...Do let me know if you spy any artifacts of value. I should like something to commemorate this trek."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 645326,
    "RowId": 36496,
    "Text": "You, of course, must have my sincerest thanks for making the perilous climb!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 645414,
    "RowId": 36497,
    "Text": "A harrowing display! Such ferocity have I rarely seen!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 645482,
    "RowId": 36498,
    "Text": "And Shishio was quite fearsome as well. It puts me in the mind of the Western chimera."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 645582,
    "RowId": 36499,
    "Text": "Yet of all that I have seen today, I am most taken with the dogu. I admit, I had my doubts...but to restore life to nature is no common feat."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 645734,
    "RowId": 36500,
    "Text": "I should like to take it back to Kugane. On the off chance it is sentient, we must hope it sees fit to forgive my earlier misgivings."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 645878,
    "RowId": 36501,
    "Text": "Our risks thus far have paid fine dividends, and I have you to thank for it. You have my utmost gratitude, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646014,
    "RowId": 36502,
    "Text": "You have done well to forestall your fate... But your end is come!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646094,
    "RowId": 36503,
    "Text": "The chorus of steel rings eternal!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646142,
    "RowId": 36504,
    "Text": "Mark where the armor readies its blade─though it has quite a reach, it cannot strike everywhere at once!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646262,
    "RowId": 36505,
    "Text": "Could this be an accursed treasure, I wonder? That blade in the box we encountered was rather suspicious as well..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646390,
    "RowId": 36506,
    "Text": "A sorry attempt at an ambush, if you ask me...but let us continue on."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646470,
    "RowId": 36600,
    "Text": "Arrive on the landfast floe"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646510,
    "RowId": 36601,
    "Text": "Clear the landfast floe"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646546,
    "RowId": 36602,
    "Text": "Arrive in Cyancap Cavern"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646582,
    "RowId": 36603,
    "Text": "Clear Cyancap Cavern"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646614,
    "RowId": 36604,
    "Text": "Arrive in the Deep Below"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 646650,
    "RowId": 36605,
    "Text": "Defeat the Octomammoth"
  },
