  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651318,
    "RowId": 36900,
    "Text": "Defeat Athena"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651342,
    "RowId": 36901,
    "Text": "Show me your all, that I might become divinity manifest!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651410,
    "RowId": 36902,
    "Text": "From nothing, I mold life!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651450,
    "RowId": 36903,
    "Text": "These chains are forged from the fabric of creation!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651514,
    "RowId": 36904,
    "Text": "To silent vessels, I give voice!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651558,
    "RowId": 36905,
    "Text": "This is but a glimpse of a god's strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651614,
    "RowId": 36906,
    "Text": "Behold such power as you will never wield!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651670,
    "RowId": 36907,
    "Text": "From the deepest pit of the seven hells to the pinnacle of the heavens, the world shall tremble!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651778,
    "RowId": 36908,
    "Text": "Such a singularly resolute soul..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651826,
    "RowId": 36909,
    "Text": "You cannot escape my eternal gaze."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651874,
    "RowId": 36910,
    "Text": "Shine brilliant for me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651910,
    "RowId": 36911,
    "Text": "Today, my theories shall be proven as fact!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 651966,
    "RowId": 36912,
    "Text": "Miscalculations are inevitable...but vexing."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652022,
    "RowId": 36913,
    "Text": "What arrogance to defy a god!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652062,
    "RowId": 36914,
    "Text": "Could my theories have been flawed...?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652114,
    "RowId": 36915,
    "Text": "Although I wished so ardently..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652158,
    "RowId": 36916,
    "Text": "But perhaps...with the Heart of Sabik!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652210,
    "RowId": 36917,
    "Text": "Yes... The flaws are not mine..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652254,
    "RowId": 36918,
    "Text": "This misbegotten world is to blame..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652302,
    "RowId": 36919,
    "Text": "Only the hands of a god can fix it─my hands!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652362,
    "RowId": 36920,
    "Text": "I can create worlds─or unmake them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652410,
    "RowId": 36921,
    "Text": "Only I can guide this star to its rightful place!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652470,
    "RowId": 36922,
    "Text": "The heavens bend to my will!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652510,
    "RowId": 36923,
    "Text": "Denizens of the abyss! From ink of blackest night, I summon you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652586,
    "RowId": 36924,
    "Text": "Misfortune hangs heavy on the prideful. Poor cover for when the heavens fall."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652674,
    "RowId": 36925,
    "Text": "From base elements is greatness forged!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652726,
    "RowId": 36926,
    "Text": "The wheel of life turns by my hand!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652774,
    "RowId": 36927,
    "Text": "The elements flow according to my design."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652826,
    "RowId": 36928,
    "Text": "Creation's course is mine to set!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652870,
    "RowId": 36929,
    "Text": "A god's will cannot be disobeyed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652914,
    "RowId": 36930,
    "Text": "This world must be made anew!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652954,
    "RowId": 36931,
    "Text": "I will not be denied!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 652986,
    "RowId": 36932,
    "Text": "Why do you suffer this pathetic existence!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 653042,
    "RowId": 36933,
    "Text": "I...I am infallible..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 653078,
    "RowId": 36934,
    "Text": "Why...does this world persist?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 653122,
    "RowId": 36935,
    "Text": "Why...do <i>I</i> persist?"
  },
  {
